  "description": "Host-neutral engine behind the Shiny agent controls - folds an AG-UI event stream (streamed text, reasoning, tool calls, activity, shared state with JSON Patch, interrupts and sub-agents) into a renderable conversation, runs frontend tools and the run/resume loop, and implements A2UI v1.0 surfaces: the message envelope, data model and bindings, collection scopes, the basic catalog's functions (formatString, the regex dialect and its safety check, TR35 dates, plural rules), checks, actions and catalog negotiation. Used by the .NET MAUI and Blazor AgentView and A2UISurface.",
